Package: cori.data.qcew
Type: Package
Title: Access and Analyze BLS Quarterly Census of Employment and Wages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Drew", "Rosebush", email = "drew.rosebush@ruralinnovation.us", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access and analyze Bureau of Labor Statistics Quarterly Census of
    Employment and Wages (QCEW) data at the county, state, and national level.
    Provides tools to download data from BLS, read processed data from S3, and
    analyze employment and wages by NAICS sector and CORI super-sector
    classification (tradable goods, tradable services, local services).
